  "description": {
    "about": {
      "items": [
        {
          "items": [
            "Nestled at the end of 30A where Rosemary Beach meets Inlet Beach, you’ll find Willow Rose Retreat, a newly built 4 bedroom beach home with a fresh and modern feel. The Preserve at Inlet Beach is a new and golf cart friendly community offering a pool with a pavilion and outdoor fireplace (just one house away) and a community dock at Lake Powell.<br><br>Willow Rose Retreat is just a few steps to the community pool and a 5 minute walk to 30Avenue boasting restaurants, shops, live music and events. So many restaurants to choose from including Donut Hole, Idyll Hound Proper, Aja, AMICI, AMIGO’S, CANOPY ROAD CAFE, CUVEE 30A, GOATFEATHERS. Also a short walk to Destin Ice Market, Ghost Crab Pizza, Shades Bar and Grill and Big Bad Breakfast.<br>A 1/2 mi. walk or bike ride brings you to public Inlet Beach access at Wall St or Winston Ln, now even easier with the new underpass for pedestrians and bikers! Or pack up your beach gear and drive 5 mins to the largest public beach access on 30A. Inlet beach Regional Access at Orange St. has ample parking, restrooms, showers and a ramped access with no stairs.<br>The picturesque community of Rosemary Beach is less than 1 mile, easy walk/bike ride/drive to fantastic restaurants and shops. Camp Helen State Park is 2 miles away, offering pristine beaches, trails that wind through dunes and along Lake Powell, one of the largest rare coastal dune lakes found only a few places in the world. Willow Rose Retreat is so close to all that 30A has to offer, yet just far enough to retreat from the crowds. Only 25 minutes to the Panama City Beach Airport (ECP)!<br><br>Willow Rose Retreat has a spacious open floor plan with a gourmet kitchen, stocked with everything you might need to enjoy a meal at home or time with family or friends. The dining table seats up to eight and the expansive island has seating for five. Enjoy the screened in porch with tv, gas fire pit and gas grill in the fully fenced backyard or relax on the welcoming front porch with rocking chairs and enjoy the view!<br><br>The Master bedroom is tucked away on the first floor with a luxurious en-suite bathroom, double sinks and walk in shower. Upstairs there are three comfortable guest rooms, two queen rooms share a jack n Jill bathroom and there is a 3rd full bathroom off the hall for the bunk room. A bonus loft area rounds out the second floor with a flat screen tv and a sofa sleeper for additional guests. <br><br>For your convenience a full size washer and dryer is located on the first floor and bikes, beach towels, cart, chairs and umbrella are provided for your stay. A Tesla charger is available in the garage. There is also a pack n play, high chair, stroller, toys and games. High speed internet is provided as well as access to your Netflix, Prime, or other streaming services through the smart TVs throughout the home. There are 2 desks, located in the master bedroom and one of the queen rooms. The home is monitored by outdoor security cameras for the safety of all of our guests. <br><br>Willow Rose Retreat comfortably accommodates up to 10 people:<br><br>Master Bedroom : 1 King Bed<br>Bedroom 2: 1 Queen Bed<br>Bedroom 3: 1 Queen Bed<br>Bedroom 4: 1 Twin over Full Bunk<br>Loft Room: 1 queen sofa sleeper<br><br>Escape to Willow Rose Retreat, and find out what it means to live the 30A life!",
            "Our prices include all fees. No hidden fees."
          ],
